.Dv NULL .
Its members are
.Va so_state ,
the lock state, one per queue (shared by every object served from it),
from
.Fn dq_serve_state_create
.Po
.Fn dq_serve_state_destroy
cancels the blocked waits and closes the owners;
.Fn dq_serve_state_owners
